WEBVTT

00:04.540 --> 00:07.630
Nice, that suits you.

00:08.600 --> 00:11.450
I'm sure everyone will be surprised

00:11.450 --> 00:13.740
once they see just how
fashionable you are.

00:13.820 --> 00:16.760
Brother, are you gonna
go out wearing that?

00:18.250 --> 00:20.210
You'll lend it to me next time?

00:20.310 --> 00:22.770
No, you don't have to.
It's okay.

00:24.060 --> 00:27.770
Wait, what's with that shirt?
Why are you taking your jacket off?

00:27.840 --> 00:31.210
Just put it back on,
your jacket provides defenses...

00:31.350 --> 00:33.170
I might be getting popular.

00:33.170 --> 00:35.751
You're finally getting popular, Brother.

00:35.753 --> 00:37.970
That's not a misunderstanding.

00:38.800 --> 00:40.620
That's totally a misunderstanding.

00:40.620 --> 00:43.090
You need to realize that
before you get hurt.

00:44.030 --> 00:47.050
You... what the heck is that?!

00:47.160 --> 00:48.970
What's up with that design?!

00:48.970 --> 00:51.090
Why would you wear that
under your uniform?!

00:51.090 --> 00:53.780
It's so lame, I'm actually starting
to get worried about you!

00:53.870 --> 00:56.000
Just looking at it makes me uneasy!

00:56.100 --> 00:58.320
Is there something troubling your mind?

00:58.320 --> 01:00.350
Or is there actually nothing
in your mind?

01:00.620 --> 01:04.560
Wait, did you get that dirt cheap
at a bargain sale?

01:04.560 --> 01:08.770
Or are you wearing that because
you honestly think that looks cool?!

01:09.050 --> 01:11.130
Are you okay?!

01:11.270 --> 01:13.740
Your fashion sense is terrible!

01:15.210 --> 01:17.290
His energy is swelling up.

01:17.290 --> 01:18.940
Is he going to attack?!

01:26.390 --> 01:28.100
(MOB MOB WOW!)

01:29.230 --> 01:30.980
(MOB MOB WOW!)

01:32.150 --> 01:33.820
(MOB MOB WOW!)

01:34.990 --> 01:36.650
(MOB MOB WOW!)

01:38.070 --> 01:40.780
I realized that our youth is grey

01:40.780 --> 01:43.700
The origin of this uneasiness
Is yet unknown

01:43.790 --> 01:46.210
Trains of emotions keep running
Through my brain

01:46.210 --> 01:49.380
Struggling through this adolescence

01:49.500 --> 01:52.340
Don't disturb my deep psyche

01:52.340 --> 01:55.010
Who is that behind you?

01:55.130 --> 01:58.800
Opposing ideas creates distortion

01:58.800 --> 02:02.220
Exorcise all the sorrow

02:02.390 --> 02:05.890
So, do what you can now

02:05.980 --> 02:07.810
My life

02:08.060 --> 02:11.940
Finally, break it down

02:13.440 --> 02:16.280
(Want) Both greed
(Young) And honesty

02:16.280 --> 02:19.160
(Burn) Are growing
(1) On this chest of mine

02:19.160 --> 02:21.910
(Trance) I'm not waking up
(Chance) I want to wake up

02:21.910 --> 02:24.870
(Stance) These two different faces of mine
(1) Are standing back-to-back

02:24.870 --> 02:27.370
Taking things as it is

02:27.370 --> 02:30.790
In this free relation where
We resent each other

02:30.880 --> 02:33.090
Once these two become one

02:33.090 --> 02:35.090
That smile becomes one

02:35.090 --> 02:38.170
And only "1"
(MOB MOB WOW!)

02:38.840 --> 02:41.840
"1"
(MOB MOB WOW!)

02:42.180 --> 02:43.260
(MOB MOB WOW!)

02:43.260 --> 02:46.140
One and only "1"
(MOB MOB WOW!)

02:46.310 --> 02:47.850
"1"

02:47.850 --> 02:49.020
(MOB MOB WOW!)

02:49.020 --> 02:51.310
One and only "1"

02:53.020 --> 02:57.530
(Divine Tree 3 ~Dimple is~)

03:04.890 --> 03:06.790
What is that light?

03:06.930 --> 03:09.460
Is that Lord Psycho Helmet's power?

03:09.520 --> 03:12.680
What is happening inside
the Divine Tree?

03:13.100 --> 03:14.630
So beautiful...

03:21.080 --> 03:23.210
Phew, that scared me.

03:23.330 --> 03:25.950
I thought he was going to explode.

03:27.340 --> 03:31.110
What's wrong?
Was it that shocking?

03:31.290 --> 03:35.130
Did you like that
lame shirt that much?

03:35.960 --> 03:37.810
Is he finally going
to attack this time?!

03:37.810 --> 03:39.960
God Barrier!

03:41.110 --> 03:42.350
Huh?

03:43.230 --> 03:45.640
That was surprisingly easy...

03:46.360 --> 03:48.160
Hey, what's wrong?

03:49.810 --> 03:52.400
I can't feel any power from Shigeo.

03:52.520 --> 03:55.470
The heck, he's completely
empty and defenseless.

03:55.970 --> 03:58.820
Did the Divine Tree
completely drain his energy?

03:58.980 --> 04:00.120
No, that's not it.

04:00.120 --> 04:06.220
Just now, he released all of his energy,
like a balloon with holes.

04:06.620 --> 04:11.580
You... Did you just let go of all of
your remaining powers just like that?

04:11.900 --> 04:14.780
And on purpose? For what?

04:15.770 --> 04:17.920
Did you get fed up with me?

04:17.920 --> 04:20.650
Are you saying you're no longer
going to try to persuade me?

04:20.650 --> 04:23.260
I don't want this to end
on an anti-climax!

04:23.360 --> 04:26.760
I even transformed into
God Dimple for this, dammit!

04:26.860 --> 04:28.990
Hey, are you listening?!

04:29.270 --> 04:32.740
Are you asleep, Shigeo?!
What are you playing?!

04:32.740 --> 04:35.950
Didn't you say that
you don't acknowledge me?!

04:36.020 --> 04:38.710
I have the power of a God.

04:38.710 --> 04:41.920
How are you going to face me
without any powers?

04:49.080 --> 04:52.590
You're facing a tough enemy
of unprecedented strength.

04:52.690 --> 04:57.240
I can finish you with just a poke
of my finger, you hear me?!

04:57.370 --> 04:58.710
You're right.

04:58.710 --> 05:01.280
But you won't do it, would you?

05:01.400 --> 05:02.860
I know.

05:03.110 --> 05:07.320
When talking with you,
having powers would only get in the way.

05:07.480 --> 05:10.410
Now we can actually talk.

05:14.470 --> 05:15.660
See?

05:16.440 --> 05:19.770
I knew I could trust you, Dimple.

05:19.770 --> 05:20.840
Huh?

05:21.420 --> 05:22.600
Trust...?

05:23.310 --> 05:25.130
Trust?

05:25.270 --> 05:26.840
But why?

05:27.320 --> 05:31.720
You told me honestly how
you felt about this shirt.

05:32.670 --> 05:34.720
You're you, Dimple.

05:34.720 --> 05:37.570
Look, you're not making
any sense here.

05:37.770 --> 05:40.570
You didn't like the way
I do things, right?!

05:40.720 --> 05:43.510
Are you sure you're
going to let me be?!

05:43.870 --> 05:47.340
I'm... a dangerous evil spirit!

05:48.350 --> 05:50.330
You're not dangerous.

05:50.630 --> 05:51.940
I know it now.

05:51.940 --> 05:52.980
Huh?

05:53.500 --> 05:56.100
You just got carried away.

05:56.220 --> 05:58.520
It happens to everyone.

06:00.390 --> 06:02.420
Master Reigen said so.

06:03.330 --> 06:04.640
That's not it.

06:04.770 --> 06:09.120
I have confidence backed
by proper hard work.

06:09.120 --> 06:13.370
Don't lump me in with people
that are just getting carried away.

06:13.680 --> 06:16.570
I also got carried away.

06:16.810 --> 06:18.270
So I understand.

06:18.430 --> 06:22.520
What? No, you're just too
reserved all the time.

06:22.520 --> 06:23.730
No.

06:24.420 --> 06:26.710
I got so conceited.

06:27.140 --> 06:28.490
I'm sorry.

06:29.530 --> 06:31.770
What do you mean, sorry...?

06:32.140 --> 06:36.520
You're not trying to win me over
with some random persuasion, are you?

06:36.930 --> 06:42.010
Back then, I got so carried away
and didn't listen to you.

06:42.330 --> 06:44.510
Why don't you give
your schemes a rest already?

06:45.150 --> 06:48.100
I should've listened properly back then.

06:49.230 --> 06:55.400
I was so focused on becoming popular
that I overlook the more important things.

06:55.890 --> 06:57.840
I'm sorry, Dimple.

06:58.510 --> 07:04.730
You're at a point where something
you've always wanted was within reach,

07:05.000 --> 07:07.870
and you invited me
to be a part of it.

07:08.160 --> 07:11.200
You could've achieved it by yourself,

07:11.620 --> 07:14.080
but you asked me to join you.

07:14.530 --> 07:18.220
That was the most important thing.

07:18.540 --> 07:20.670
It wasn't just some schemes.

07:20.670 --> 07:23.880
You just wanted to do
the thing you always wanted,

07:24.110 --> 07:25.680
together with me.

07:26.590 --> 07:31.060
You trusted me before I trusted you.

07:32.190 --> 07:33.500
Thank you.

07:33.900 --> 07:35.970
H-hey, stop that.

07:36.410 --> 07:39.920
Don't just put words in my mouth.

07:40.080 --> 07:43.770
That's too creepy.
You're giving me chills here.

07:44.400 --> 07:46.570
Something didn't feel right.

07:46.760 --> 07:50.370
I had a vague feeling that
this isn't right.

07:50.990 --> 07:55.800
I had so many followers
and nothing could oppose me.

07:56.060 --> 07:58.840
I became the center of the world.
I achieved that.

07:59.040 --> 08:03.180
Almost everything went as planned,
and I became a God...

08:03.260 --> 08:05.340
But it wasn't fun at all.

08:06.700 --> 08:09.630
I couldn't empathize with him
on so many things.

08:09.730 --> 08:13.190
Like how he wouldn't use
his psychic powers for daily life.

08:13.330 --> 08:16.710
Or like how he wouldn't
listen to my tricks.

08:16.890 --> 08:18.670
Or how indecisive he is.

08:18.670 --> 08:20.470
Yes, there are times
when it pisses me off.

08:20.760 --> 08:25.440
But when I know the only thing he wants
is for the girl he likes to notice him,

08:25.570 --> 08:29.680
I felt that he was concealing
the same emotion as I do.

08:31.180 --> 08:34.750
We want our existence
to be acknowledged.

08:36.080 --> 08:40.830
After the (LOL) case,
he recognizes me as a spirit.

08:41.250 --> 08:44.070
He's not afraid of me.
He doesn't hate me.

08:44.070 --> 08:46.940
Eventually, he accepted me.

08:47.130 --> 08:50.460
Back then, I thought
I could manipulate him.

08:50.620 --> 08:56.380
Besides that, I felt a certain tension
in my heart beginning to relax.

08:56.570 --> 09:02.350
Did spending time with the selfless Shigeo
cause me to lose sight of my goals?

09:02.460 --> 09:05.370
Wait, isn't that bad?

09:05.490 --> 09:08.360
That means I would lose
my reason to exist!

09:08.470 --> 09:10.940
No, this is just the beginning!

09:11.120 --> 09:15.790
I still have so many things I want to do!
So many ambitions!

09:15.940 --> 09:17.030
Yeah.

09:17.470 --> 09:18.490
Yeah.

09:19.020 --> 09:22.520
I will listen properly,
about what you want to do.

09:22.600 --> 09:24.490
As your friend.

09:32.160 --> 09:35.630
Eh, I guess I don't really need
this God and followers thingy.

09:36.390 --> 09:38.590
I never noticed it all this time.

09:38.820 --> 09:40.280
But I...

09:41.230 --> 09:43.440
I wanted a friend.

09:45.020 --> 09:48.770
Shigeo, you really are amazing.

09:50.500 --> 09:52.580
Fine, I'm done with this.

09:52.690 --> 09:55.170
I'll stop interfering with people's minds.

09:55.170 --> 09:59.610
I'll erase their memory relating to
the fake Psycho Helmet I created as well.

09:59.710 --> 10:01.870
Then everyone will be
back to their usual.

10:01.920 --> 10:04.560
When the source of
the worship energy is gone,

10:04.560 --> 10:06.910
I'll lose my God powers as well.

10:08.030 --> 10:10.980
Then I'll be back to how
I used to be as well.

10:11.190 --> 10:13.380
-Is that really okay with you?
-What?

10:13.920 --> 10:16.470
Wasn't it your dream to be a God?

10:16.840 --> 10:22.300
I'm saying your stupid, incoherent argument
managed to convince me, dammit!

10:22.400 --> 10:24.640
Oh, I see.

10:34.710 --> 10:36.830
-Let's go home, shall we?
-Yeah.

10:39.900 --> 10:42.200
H-hey, what's wrong, Shigeo?

10:42.360 --> 10:45.060
I think I released
too much of my power.

10:45.060 --> 10:48.200
Well, I mean, that's your own fault.

10:48.440 --> 10:53.470
Geez, why are you
so clumsy about things?

10:54.090 --> 10:57.040
Fine, here.

11:07.980 --> 11:10.920
You always collapsed like this back

11:10.920 --> 11:13.470
when you first joined
Body Improvement Club.

11:14.460 --> 11:17.480
Are you always going
to look like that?

11:18.200 --> 11:23.320
It'll probably take a week before
my God powers naturally disappear.

11:24.000 --> 11:28.330
Can I ask you to not come
to my home before that?

11:28.540 --> 11:32.200
Man, you're really brutal
sometimes, you know?

11:32.300 --> 11:34.190
Oh, that's right.

11:34.300 --> 11:37.370
I have to do something
about the broccoli.

11:37.550 --> 11:40.320
Oh, right.
What was your plan anyway?

11:40.610 --> 11:43.220
Lift it up with telekinesis
and sink it into the ocean.

11:43.220 --> 11:46.520
What?! What makes
you think you can...

11:46.630 --> 11:50.990
No, wait, you probably can.
That's what's so scary about you.

11:52.910 --> 11:55.180
It's a nice, huge broccoli.

11:55.360 --> 11:58.230
It's even starting to turn
into a tourist attraction.

11:58.440 --> 12:02.340
I kinda feel bad about it,
but we have no choice.

12:02.440 --> 12:07.400
People are fascinated with mystical
or overwhelming stuff, after all.

12:07.500 --> 12:12.120
I'm sure this broccoli will stay deep
within everyone's memory.

12:14.240 --> 12:16.210
-I'm...
-Huh?

12:17.870 --> 12:20.480
I'm getting really sleepy.

12:20.480 --> 12:22.720
Can you wake me up
once we're at home?

12:22.890 --> 12:25.200
I'm not your servant, dammit.

12:25.200 --> 12:27.180
Who do you think I...

12:29.840 --> 12:32.090
You better not drool on me.

12:32.680 --> 12:38.460
He said go home, but I don't exactly
have a place I could call home.

12:38.570 --> 12:40.480
Especially not after losing my goals.

12:40.480 --> 12:41.900
What do I do now?

12:43.470 --> 12:45.110
Hey.

12:50.590 --> 12:51.540
What...?

12:59.230 --> 13:01.690
Psycho Helmet...

13:01.960 --> 13:05.550
But I'm not controlling
the Divine Tree anymore...

13:05.630 --> 13:08.650
Who the heck are you...?

13:09.450 --> 13:13.140
Hang on, I got a bad feeling about this...

13:16.140 --> 13:19.230
After absorbing my and
the followers' thoughts,

13:19.230 --> 13:22.220
the Divine Tree developed sentience.

13:22.320 --> 13:26.490
If it has developed a sense of self
as the Psycho Helmet

13:26.490 --> 13:33.260
and waiting vigilantly for when
I let go of all this massive energy...

13:41.040 --> 13:42.750
That thing.

13:42.750 --> 13:44.300
Put it down.

13:44.900 --> 13:46.130
That nourishment.

13:46.380 --> 13:49.930
Shigeo, wake up!
This is really bad!

13:52.450 --> 13:54.490
Dammit, really?!

13:54.810 --> 13:58.270
Wake up, Shigeo!
This isn't the time to be asleep!

13:58.620 --> 14:01.080
No good, he's not waking up.

14:09.330 --> 14:11.280
God Beam!

14:25.120 --> 14:26.840
Goddamn you!

14:26.840 --> 14:30.470
Give Shigeo back!

14:40.680 --> 14:42.300
Wait here.

14:49.410 --> 14:54.640
Hand it over... Hand it over...
Hand it over...

15:03.840 --> 15:08.890
Hand it over... Hand it over...
Hand it over...

15:12.830 --> 15:14.800
Hand it over.

15:45.360 --> 15:47.040
What was that...?

15:48.560 --> 15:53.550
Hand it over... Hand it over...
Hand it over...

15:56.240 --> 15:58.400
My power...

15:59.020 --> 16:00.890
It's being drained away!

16:07.850 --> 16:10.740
God Beam!

16:50.980 --> 16:54.150
Hand it over!

18:07.730 --> 18:09.930
Oh, you're awake.

18:10.250 --> 18:11.950
Can you move now?

18:12.440 --> 18:15.600
Not yet, I still can't move at all...

18:15.760 --> 18:17.680
My eyes can't see very well, either.

18:17.790 --> 18:19.230
Is that so?

18:19.340 --> 18:21.890
I think I heard a loud sound.

18:21.890 --> 18:23.290
Did something happen?

18:23.400 --> 18:26.340
Not really, no.
Maybe you were dreaming?

18:26.490 --> 18:29.040
Are we at home yet?

18:29.130 --> 18:31.500
We're taking a little break.

18:31.500 --> 18:33.660
Even I'm a bit tired.

18:33.870 --> 18:35.700
I see...

18:36.030 --> 18:37.240
Shigeo.

18:37.240 --> 18:41.630
This is the first time
I ever used a power this big.

18:41.940 --> 18:47.560
You've been living all this time
with this level of psychic powers.

18:48.530 --> 18:53.450
Now I finally can understand
just how amazing you are.

18:53.670 --> 18:56.440
Getting carried away because you think
you're getting popular with women?

18:56.440 --> 18:58.310
That's cute compared to this.

18:58.910 --> 19:02.910
Anyone obviously would get carried away
if they have this much power.

19:02.910 --> 19:05.790
It's only natural to end up
abusing such power.

19:06.090 --> 19:08.750
But you...

19:11.340 --> 19:12.960
You're a real man.

19:12.960 --> 19:14.750
You're going to be something big.

19:15.550 --> 19:19.320
With how you are right now,
I can actually hypnotize you.

19:19.740 --> 19:24.200
Listen carefully. This is my first
and last order for you.

19:24.480 --> 19:27.910
First, wake up.
Stand up, Shigeo.

19:29.920 --> 19:33.790
I can't put any strength in my legs.
I can't move my arms either.

19:33.790 --> 19:37.880
I don't care if your body is trembling
or something. Stand up.

19:38.110 --> 19:41.530
Even if you can't stand,
you have to stand up.

19:41.630 --> 19:44.750
And then walk with
your own two legs.

19:45.430 --> 19:46.690
Go.

19:47.480 --> 19:48.620
What about you?

19:48.620 --> 19:51.310
I gotta go somewhere else for a bit.

19:51.530 --> 19:54.030
-You go on first.
-Okay.

20:27.160 --> 20:28.830
Take care.

21:19.560 --> 21:21.800
L-let's go home.

21:22.600 --> 21:24.010
Everyone.

21:24.860 --> 21:26.560
Let's go home.

21:46.970 --> 21:49.420
Brother, there's something big
happening in the news.

21:49.420 --> 21:51.950
That wasn't your doing, right?

21:52.480 --> 21:53.910
Take a look!

21:54.010 --> 21:57.260
This is footage from a moment ago!

21:57.440 --> 22:00.720
The giant plant known as the Divine Tree
that suddenly appeared

22:00.720 --> 22:03.050
is floating in the air!

22:03.320 --> 22:06.200
What on earth is going on?

22:07.230 --> 22:11.580
I don't know who is the culprit,
but what are they trying to accomplish?

22:11.680 --> 22:13.350
How mysterious...

22:13.690 --> 22:15.850
Oh, speaking of mysterious,

22:15.850 --> 22:18.800
my memories from around
this evening are pretty fuzzy.

22:18.800 --> 22:20.650
Is it the same for you?

22:23.780 --> 22:25.980
I can't remember as well.

22:26.140 --> 22:28.280
How did I get home
in the first place?

22:28.800 --> 22:30.030
You too?

22:30.180 --> 22:34.160
Is this some sort of mass hypnosis?

22:35.040 --> 22:38.780
I think Dimple would know more about
this kind of mysterious thing.

22:38.780 --> 22:40.670
I'll ask him the next time I see him.

22:42.380 --> 22:44.590
Brother, are you okay?

22:44.590 --> 22:45.680
Yeah.

22:46.000 --> 22:49.050
But I want to lie down for a bit.

22:57.760 --> 22:59.710
I can't remember.

23:01.690 --> 23:03.560
I can't remember.

23:03.680 --> 23:04.980
But...

23:08.600 --> 23:11.450
Dimple, thank you...

23:12.080 --> 23:15.700
You're my friend, Dimple.

23:26.400 --> 23:27.870
Uh, sorry, what was that again?

23:27.870 --> 23:31.190
You're going to call UFO using telepathy on
Mt. Mud Boat's summit on New Year's Eve?

23:31.190 --> 23:33.310
And I have to drive you there?
Are you kidding me?

23:33.400 --> 23:35.350
Next on episode seven of
Mob Psycho 100 III,

23:35.350 --> 23:37.080
"Communicating 1 ~Winter Break~"

23:37.180 --> 23:40.110
Buying sets?
Indeed, that's a wise decision.
